# 固化行尾规则 —— 修 worktree 检出后 gradlew 变 CRLF 导致 ./gradlew 跑不起来的问题。
#
# 背景:仓库里存的是 LF,但本机 core.autocrlf=true,新建 worktree 时
# gradlew 被检出成 CRLF,导致 `#!/usr/bin/env sh\r` 报
# "can't access tty / No such file or directory"。
#
# 规则:
#   *.sh / gradlew 等 shell 脚本 → 仓库存 LF,检出也用 LF(eol=lf)
#   文本源码 → 仓库存 LF,检出转 CRLF 不做(eol=lf 保持一致)
#   二进制 → 不动

* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.gradle text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.properties text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.apk binary
*.so binary
*.jar binary
*.aar binary
*.db binary
